# Without this, `COPY src/ src/` drops the host's bin/ and obj/ into the image, overwriting
# the restore the build stage just did — and the build fails on packages that exist only in
# the host's NuGet cache.
**/bin/
**/obj/

**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/TestResults/

.git/
.github/
tests/
compose.yaml
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
